      <title>Ross County Commissioners proclaim February as Black History Month</title>
      <link>https://sciotovalleyguardian.com/2026/02/17/ross-county-commissioners-proclaim-february-as-black-history-month/</link>
      <description>CHILLICOTHE, Ohio — The Ross County Board of Commissioners on Tuesday issued a proclamation recognizing February 2026 as Black History Month, marking a century of national Black history commemorations. The observance traces its origins to 1926, when historian Carter G. Woodson and fellow scholars established Negro History Week, which later expanded into Black History Month. […]</description>
